  <!-- Area painting (src/Building/AreaPaintingState.cs).
       Drives keyboard expand/shrink of an Area with shape selection,
       per-cell toggling, and stage-then-confirm.

       EnterExpand / EnterShrink: {0} = area label, {1} = shape name.
       The hint suffix (Tab to switch mode... Enter to confirm) is split
       out as PromptHint so the verb-prefixed keys stay short.

       Confirmed: {0} = action verb (added to / removed from),
       {1} = area label, {2} = total cells. Per the no-glue rule,
       AddedTo / RemovedFrom whole-phrase variants own the verb-and-label
       phrasing instead of swapping a verb particle.

       ConfirmShape{Regular,Irregular}: {0} = "WxH" string, {1} = added
       count, {2} = staged total (Regular only adds the dimension info). -->
  <RimWorldAccess.Building.Paint.ModeBox>Box selection mode</RimWorldAccess.Building.Paint.ModeBox>
  <RimWorldAccess.Building.Paint.ModeSingle>Single tile selection mode</RimWorldAccess.Building.Paint.ModeSingle>
